  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What the receiver establishes",
      "items": [
        "A correlated implicit main-file first-page read, or healthy complete none, within the declared catalog.",
        "Client-selected model is persisted; backend identity, all pages and semantic adherence are not verified."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Finalization and timing",
      "items": [
        "Cleanup attempts group signaling before reap; EOF proves no descendant absence. A host fast-exit signal failure stays cleanup-uncertain and routing-unknown.",
        "Drain precedes finalized routing and matching receipt. Controller timing deduplicates attempts, not provider latency.",
        "Late grading/source drift blocks trials and revokes affirmative client-model claims."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Implementation is not qualification",
      "items": [
        "Bound persisted cost survives routing/model/clock admission failure; incomplete attempts block the next launch.",
        "Changed-source native qualification is pending; current offline checks use FAKE qualifications and native journals.",
        "Outcome and routing remain separate. No live, merge/install authority or unseen-case claim follows."
      ]
    }
